[SPEAKER_01]: And unfortunately, I think Prince Jeon himself doesn't fully understand what the Toli are doing.

18:30.746 --> 18:43.296
[SPEAKER_01]: I've gotten information that the Scarlet Brotherhood are not only infiltrating the Sea Principalities, they're also infiltrating Keoland.

18:44.056 --> 18:45.517
