18:47.189 --> 18:53.891
[SPEAKER_01]: Between Keoland and the Sea Principalities are being stoked by the Scarlet Brotherhood to their benefit.

18:53.931 --> 18:58.532
[SPEAKER_00]: Remember when I talked to that Baron of Redlaw?

18:58.832 --> 18:59.292
[SPEAKER_00]: Red Shore.

18:59.352 --> 18:59.772
[SPEAKER_00]: Red Shore.

19:00.352 --> 19:08.254
[SPEAKER_00]: And I had mentioned to you that he seemed surprised that I told him that Jeon, Prince Jeon, was against slavery.

19:09.737 --> 19:17.403
[SPEAKER_00]: Because they were thinking, or he was believing that Gradsul and them were taking up this cause.

